# Never convert line endings in binary artifacts (models, packages, samples, firmware).
# Git guesses "binary" only from NUL bytes; a small file without one would be corrupted by
# core.autocrlf on Windows (seen with an EEMBC kws01 .bin file).
*.bin    binary
*.tflite binary
*.npy    binary
*.npz    binary
*.h5     binary
*.wav    binary
